      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC11378927::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy begins testing without prior wear or corrosion.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is exposure of the alloy to tribocorrosion while mechanical and electrochemical quantities are measured.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed response is relevant to high-temperature, high-humidity, or high-salinity environments.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC11378927::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A passive film forms on the surface of the high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alloy composition can influence the surface passive film.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alloy microstructure can influence the surface passive film.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical wear affects the passive film.",
